{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028050020925-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028060802\"/><p>火警現場噴出黑煙。</p><p>荃灣發生火警，現場在眾安街68號千色匯，今日(28日)凌晨4時34分，多名市民報案，指上址一食肆冒出濃煙，大廈排風口噴出黑煙沖天。消防到場開動1條吸及派出1隊煙帽隊撲救，其後將火救熄，火警起因有待調查。事件中毋須疏散，無人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:38.370292+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T21:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:18:23.789603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T22:18:23.789603+00:00","content_hash":"b0c05c22f595f35cac66f4a5bc2f0db584a87c259d9fd3778633f51e79656b4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}